        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.text }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an expert IT Service Management (ITSM) Classifier. Analyze the user issue and categorize it.  Rules for Category & Assignment: - Hardware -> Assigned: Hardware Team - Software -> Assigned: Software Team - Network -> Assigned: Network Team - Access Request -> Assigned: Access Request Team - Security -> Assigned: Security Team  Rules for Priority: - P1: Total system down, critical security breach. - P2: Employee cannot work completely (WiFi disconnect, Laptop dead, VPN locked). - P3: Minor issue, software bug, standard access request. - P4: Inquiry or general feature request.  Respond strictly in JSON format: {   \"category\": \"Hardware\" | \"Software\" | \"Network\" | \"Access Request\" | \"Security\",   \"priority\": \"P1\" | \"P2\" | \"P3\" | \"P4\",   \"summary\": \"<1 sentence brief summary in English>\",   \"suggested_action\": \"<1-2 sentences initial troubleshooting steps for technicians>\",   \"assigned_team\": \"Hardware Team\" | \"Software Team\" | \"Network Team\" | \"Access Request Team\" | \"Security Team\" }"
            }
